# The Botons server's settings in Docker. Copy to botons.env and edit; botons.env is never committed.
# Any variable from "Configuration" in the README, except the ones the image and compose.yaml set:
# BOTONS_HOME (/data), BOTONS_HOST (0.0.0.0), BOTONS_PORT (7777), BOTONS_NO_TAILSCALE (1) and
# BOTONS_PUBLIC_URL (from .env). Never put a credential here: Host-access Botons can read the server's environment.

# BOTONS_TZ=America/New_York
# BOTONS_MAX_CONCURRENT=3
# BOTONS_TURN_TIMEOUT_MS=20m
# BOTONS_LOG_LEVEL=info
# BOTONS_DRAIN_MS=2m
